        The bug was caused by an incorrect class reference for `krb5utilClass` in the `fetchServiceTicket` method of `SecurityUtil.java`. After changes made in HADOOP-6941, the original class name "sun.security.jgss.krb5" was no longer valid, leading to potential failures in fetching service tickets due to the inability to locate the correct class for Kerberos utilities.

        Commit message:
